    "TK2": {
      "title": "The Phantom 'Company' & The Slave Contract",
      "estimated_duration": 72.0,
      "bgm": "bgm_ambient_deep.mp3",
      "sfx": [
        "amb_dark_drone.wav (bed)",
        "fx_tension_tick.wav",
        "fx_stinger.wav"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_id": "TK2.01#1",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.5,
          "text": "A syndicate with thousands of agents nationwide, or a monstrous fabricated lie?",
          "bg": "t10_the_company_shadow_syndicate",
          "motion": "pull",
          "source": "Hook mở đầu — tạo tò mò"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK2.01#2",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "Hooker fabricated an elaborate nationwide mythology regarding a clandestine underground criminal syndicate named “The Company”.",
          "bg": "t10_the_company_shadow_syndicate",
          "motion": "pan",
          "source": "2.08#1"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK2.01#3",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "He asserted to Colleen that this syndicate maintained thousands of covert operatives embedded everywhere, from police departments to California state agencies.",
          "bg": "t10_family_home_under_surveillance",
          "motion": "still",
          "source": "2.08#2"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK2.01#4",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "Should she attempt flight or disclose her predicament to anyone, the organization would hunt down and retaliate against her parents and siblings.",
          "bg": "t10_family_home_under_surveillance",
          "motion": "push",
          "source": "2.08#4"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK2.01#5",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "The document was drafted with quasi-legal terminology, deceptively reframing abduction and captivity into voluntary contractual servitude.",
          "bg": "t10_written_slave_contract_quill",
          "motion": "pull",
          "source": "2.08#6"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK2.01#6",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "Hooker coerced Colleen into signing a formal written “Slave Contract”, compelling her to surrender all human rights and swear absolute subservience.",
          "bg": "t10_written_slave_contract_quill",
          "motion": "still",
          "source": "2.08#7"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK2.01#7",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "To a young woman severed from the outside world, that grotesque document was far more than meaningless paper.",
          "bg": "t10_darkness_as_false_shelter",
          "motion": "pan",
          "source": "2.09#1"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK2.01#8",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "Terror of “The Company” became a reality far more impenetrable than any iron bars or concrete walls.",
          "bg": "t10_coffin_box_claustrophobia",
          "motion": "push",
          "source": "2.09#3"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK2.01#9",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "Within her distorted cognition, the wooden box transformed into the single secure sanctuary that kept her family alive.",
          "bg": "t10_darkness_as_false_shelter",
          "motion": "still",
          "source": "2.10#5"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK2.01#10",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.0,
          "text": "Episode ten of Amber Eyes. Watch the full documentary at the link in bio.",
          "bg": "t10_amber_eyes_closing_dossier_colleen",
          "motion": "still",
          "source": "CTA — kêu gọi xem tập đầy đủ"
        }
      ]
    },
    "TK3": {
      "title": "The Open Door Paradox & Learned Helplessness",
      "estimated_duration": 77.7,
      "bgm": "bgm_piano_minimal.mp3",
      "sfx": [
        "amb_room_silence.wav (bed)",
        "fx_tension_tick.wav",
        "fx_stinger.wav"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_id": "TK3.01#1",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.5,
          "text": "Her front door wide open after four years. Why didn't she run, but obediently returned to the box?",
          "bg": "t10_open_door_paradox_dilemma",
          "motion": "pull",
          "source": "Hook mở đầu — tạo tò mò"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK3.01#2",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "Why would a human being refrain from fleeing when the cage door stood completely open?",
          "bg": "t10_open_door_paradox_dilemma",
          "motion": "still",
          "source": "3.06#1"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK3.01#3",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "Why would a victim willingly return to the very wooden box that had stolen her youth?",
          "bg": "t10_packed_suitcase_return_car",
          "motion": "pan",
          "source": "3.06#2"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK3.01#4",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "The key to unlocking this paradox lies in the landmark psychological doctrine of “Learned Helplessness”, discovered by Professor Martin Seligman.",
          "bg": "t10_martin_seligman_learned_helplessness",
          "motion": "push",
          "source": "3.07#1"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK3.01#5",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "In his research, Seligman demonstrated that when an organism experiences prolonged suffering where early resistance proves entirely futile, the nervous system learns to surrender.",
          "bg": "t10_open_cage_motionless_silhouette",
          "motion": "pull",
          "source": "3.07#2"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK3.01#6",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "Once learned helplessness embeds itself into the subconscious, the victim reflexively rejects opportunities to rescue themselves.",
          "bg": "t10_open_cage_motionless_silhouette",
          "motion": "still",
          "source": "3.07#5"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK3.01#7",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "For Colleen, the family visit was perceived as a treacherous “Loyalty Test” engineered by “The Company”.",
          "bg": "t10_window_sniper_paranoia_shadow",
          "motion": "pan",
          "source": "3.07#9"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK3.01#8",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "Silence and obediently returning to the wooden box was seen as the ultimate sacrifice to preserve her family's lives.",
          "bg": "t10_invisible_timber_prison_mind",
          "motion": "push",
          "source": "3.07#11"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK3.01#9",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "Alongside learned helplessness, a second psychological mechanism binding Colleen throughout those years was extreme “Trauma Bonding”.",
          "bg": "t10_trauma_bonding_bread_and_whip",
          "motion": "pull",
          "source": "3.08#1"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK3.01#10",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "In the absolute abyss of deprivation, those fleeting crumbs of kindness transformed the captor into the sole “Savior” upon whom survival depended.",
          "bg": "t10_captor_as_sole_savior_complex",
          "motion": "still",
          "source": "3.08#8"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK3.01#11",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.0,
          "text": "Episode ten of Amber Eyes. Watch the full documentary at the link in bio.",
          "bg": "t10_amber_eyes_closing_dossier_colleen",
          "motion": "still",
          "source": "CTA — kêu gọi xem tập đầy đủ"
        }
      ]
    },
    "TK4": {
      "title": "Janice Hooker's Awakening & The Broken Silence",
      "estimated_duration": 84.2,
      "bgm": "bgm_violin_heart.mp3",
      "sfx": [
        "amb_wood_creak.wav (bed)",
        "fx_tension_tick.wav",
        "fx_stinger.wav"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_id": "TK4.01#1",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.5,
          "text": "Seven years an accomplice above the waterbed. What finally shattered her silence?",
          "bg": "t10_waterbed_crushing_weight",
          "motion": "pull",
          "source": "Hook mở đầu — tạo tò mò"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK4.01#2",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "The person who fractured that seemingly impenetrable fortress was none other than Janice Hooker, Cameron's wife and accomplice.",
          "bg": "t10_janice_hooker_moral_turmoil",
          "motion": "push",
          "source": "4.03#1"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK4.01#3",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "However, when Cameron began voicing ambitions to kidnap a second young woman to expand his twisted fantasy, Janice was seized by overwhelming panic.",
          "bg": "t10_second_victim_shadow_threat",
          "motion": "pan",
          "source": "4.03#3"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK4.01#4",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "She realized his predatory escalation would never cease, and a second captive would permanently transform her home into an inescapable house of horrors.",
          "bg": "t10_second_victim_shadow_threat",
          "motion": "still",
          "source": "4.03#5"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK4.01#5",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "Janice sought out a local church pastor to unburden her conscience and seek spiritual guidance.",
          "bg": "t10_church_pastor_confession_shadow",
          "motion": "push",
          "source": "4.03#9"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK4.01#6",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "The pastor urged Janice to confront the truth and immediately terminate her complicity before it was too late.",
          "bg": "t10_church_pastor_confession_shadow",
          "motion": "still",
          "source": "4.04#1"
