          "line_id": "TK4.01#9",
          "role": "N2",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "I held Colleen's hand and spoke the truth: “Cameron does not belong to any Company, it was all his twisted lie to keep you enslaved.”",
          "bg": "t10_truth_revealed_shattered_phantom",
          "motion": "push",
          "source": "4.05#8"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK4.01#10",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "The monolithic terror of “The Company” dissolved in a heartbeat, restoring her innate will to survive.",
          "bg": "t10_truth_revealed_shattered_phantom",
          "motion": "still",
          "source": "4.07#2"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK4.01#11",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
