    "TK5": {
      "title": "4 Survival Red Flags Against Coercive Predators",
      "estimated_duration": 79.9,
      "bgm": "bgm_piano_warm.mp3",
      "sfx": [
        "amb_morning_breeze.wav (bed)",
        "fx_tension_tick.wav",
        "fx_stinger.wav"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_id": "TK5.01#1",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.5,
          "text": "The strongest prison is never made of wood, but the feeling of utter helplessness in your mind.",
          "bg": "t10_breaking_invisible_chains_dawn",
          "motion": "pull",
          "source": "Hook mở đầu — tạo tò mò"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK5.01#2",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "To safeguard ourselves and those we cherish against predatory manipulation, Amber eyes distills four survival red flags from this history, grounded in Gavin de Becker's “The Gift of Fear”.",
          "bg": "t10_fbi_academy_profiling_archive",
          "motion": "still",
          "source": "5.05#1"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK5.01#3",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "First red flag: Beware the “Halo Effect” and seemingly harmless veneers.",
          "bg": "t10_redflag1_trojan_innocence_trap",
          "motion": "pan",
          "source": "5.05#2"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK5.01#4",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "The most dangerous manipulators rarely project overt hostility, masking themselves behind warm families, innocent children, or excessive courtesy to disarm vigilance.",
          "bg": "t10_redflag1_trojan_innocence_trap",
          "motion": "still",
          "source": "5.05#3"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK5.01#5",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "Second red flag: Recognize tactics of spatial isolation and information starvation.",
          "bg": "t10_redflag2_spatial_isolation_grid",
          "motion": "push",
          "source": "5.05#4"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK5.01#6",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "Every toxic relationship begins by severing connections with loved ones, friends, and outside sources, establishing the manipulator as the sole arbiter of reality.",
          "bg": "t10_redflag2_spatial_isolation_grid",
          "motion": "still",
          "source": "5.05#5"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK5.01#7",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "Third red flag: Maintain clarity when facing “Imaginary Enemies” and fabricated threats.",
          "bg": "t10_redflag3_phantom_enemy_mirror",
          "motion": "pull",
          "source": "5.05#6"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK5.01#8",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "Manipulators invent phantom perils to instill paralyzing fear, positioning themselves as the sole protector you must obey.",
          "bg": "t10_redflag3_phantom_enemy_mirror",
          "motion": "still",
          "source": "5.05#7"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK5.01#9",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "Fourth red flag: Shatter “Learned Helplessness” within your own consciousness.",
          "bg": "t10_redflag4_breaking_helplessness_sparks",
          "motion": "push",
          "source": "5.05#8"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK5.01#10",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
          "pause_after": 0.6,
          "text": "The most formidable prison is never a wooden box under a bed, but the surrendered belief that one is powerless before adversity.",
          "bg": "t10_breaking_invisible_chains_dawn",
          "motion": "pan",
          "source": "5.05#10"
        },
        {
          "line_id": "TK5.01#11",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed": -0.02,
